gtkdialog source build
======================

The runtime package contains a prebuilt gtkdialog binary so normal ThinStation
image builds do not need a compiler toolchain.

To regenerate it on Fedora, install these build dependencies:

    dnf install gcc meson ninja-build pkgconf-pkg-config gtk2-devel \
        glib2-devel bison flex git

Then run:

    ts/build/packages/gtkdialog/rebuild

The source is pinned by default to upstream commit:

    d4fb57727826ee43fb6d58ca6b837509e96202c7

This upstream revision identifies itself as gtkdialog 0.8.5 and contains the
GCC 14+ compatibility fixes. Override GTKDIALOG_COMMIT or GTKDIALOG_REPO when
testing a newer upstream revision.
